[image or embed]
Donnie D’Amato attempted a more-native solution using ::highlight()
, but ::highlight()
has some limitations, unfortunately. As Henry Wilkinson mentioned, Hazel Bachrach’s 2019 call for a native solution is still an open ticket, so fingers crossed!
